@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom order-triage runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts` is the custom-runtime factory for the `order-triage` agent. It awaits the runtime-supplied canonical instruction loader with `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`, then exposes classification for human review with refund approval disabled.
+
+The loader implementation is supplied by the factory caller and is not defined in this repository. The repository does not establish a model provider, tools, or additional decision authority.
